Z||000000||billfredmike24||10-24-2000||03:49 PM||||Has anyone come across any tsw blades on the net or maybe even in any stores in the U.S. i know they've been discontinued but on the web site they sell 16" for $109 in silver.  I was hoping to buy a set but with the canadian exchange rate it's a lot of dough.  If anyone has any info could you let me know.<BR>TIA||||reg||1
Z||000001||RiceCooker||10-24-2000||07:45 PM||||I bought my TSW blades back in February of this year. I talked directly with TSW in california and the guy said they were discontinued. He gave me the vitals on their closest dealer to me in Vancouver B.C.<BR>I talked to Robert at Trend Motoring and I got them for $225 each which wasn't too bad. They only had 2 sets left at the time so give 'em a call. (604) 323-8369<BR>Good Luck<P>P.S. Keep looking, these wheels are worth the search.<P>Another option is Archie - the V8 guy. I know he has them on several of his cars. Maybe he knows where to get them.||||reg||1
